					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Peer pressure as an SCP is a pretty funny idea, but the execution is just a bit too blunt for my tastes.</p> <p>Speaking of blunt&#8230;you wanna come smoke a reefer with us round the back of the bike shed? All the cool kids are doing it&#8230;</p> 
